  "comments": "Example for התשנ״ח (smooth numeral outlines; error: coin alignment)<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5805165dd67ab.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5805165dd67ab.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"113\" /></a><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5edf91a0de9c6.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5edf91a0de9c6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br />\r\n1997 difference in date<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/605101d088d1d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/605101d088d1d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"99\" /></a><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5dcab2cae2c2f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5dcab2cae2c2f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br />\r\nDifferences in font, square size and rim thickness<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5ec567d3b83d0.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5ec567d3b83d0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"106\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nOf the coins dated 5746 (1986), 20,934,048 were minted in Jerusalem and 71,820,000 were minted in Bern.<br />\r\nOf the coins dated 5751 (1991), 11,905,000 were minted in Jerusalem, 30,240,000 were minted in Santiago, and 17,280,000 were minted in Stuttgart.<br />\r\nOf the coins dated 5754 (1994), 21,600,000 were minted in Stuttgart and 30,096,000 were minted in Utrecht.<br />\r\nOf the coins dated 5759 (1999), 21,600,000 were minted in Athens, 4,601,000 were minted in Daejeon, and 2,000 were minted in Winipeg",
